    "At the heart of our operating architecture is the low-cost broad-market index fund, described by legendary investors as the greatest democratic innovation in financial history. By holding fractional shares of the thousands of largest corporations across the United States and the global economy, you eliminate individual company bankruptcy risk entirely. If an individual technology company collapses due to executive scandal, accounting fraud, or technological obsolescence, your portfolio barely notices, because the broader economic engine of human productivity continues expanding. You harness the aggregate power of capitalism without staking your life savings on any single firm or speculative trend.",

